{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026StNC9qs3MN1795169058.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港二手樓價連跌6周。</p><p></p><p>中原城市領先指數，最新報157.56點，按周比較，跌百分之0.66，是自5月底以來的低位。</p><p></p><p>四區樓價全線受壓，新界東結束3周連升，九龍及新界西也連跌兩周，港島連續6周向下。編制指數的機構表示，港股下挫，加息預期升溫等不利因素影響，料年底前指數下試155點。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.116124+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:16.098276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:19.891086+00:00","content_hash":"70c3f7e4b9e364a3ff1f9388e380b57681f3e1e05fae3d3dc7f7bf5ecbe222e1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.116124+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}